{
  "purpose": "Expressiveness test set. Each case is a real situation that occurs in site cabinets. The question is not 'does this JSON validate' but 'can the schema represent this situation without losing information'. A case that validates while silently discarding reality is the most dangerous outcome, because nothing alerts anyone.",
  "expectations": {
    "expressible": "Schema represents the situation fully. Must validate.",
    "gap_silent": "Schema accepts a document but information is lost with no signal. DANGEROUS - fix before labelling.",
    "gap_loud": "Schema rejects the document. Undesirable but safe, because it fails visibly."
  },
